  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8722;</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>&#961;</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/eabdc042-7c49-46cf-8f56-c8a020fb5382-0a677acd-b104-48b4-8d49-3ff3ed6ab3a4-image.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 196px;\" /></p><p>Here we can write now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>&#961;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#961;</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mi>d</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>&#961;</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>&#961;</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>&#961;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#961;</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mi>d</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8722;</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>&#961;</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>a</mi></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>Compare it&nbsp;with given equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>a</mi></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>Now check the options,</p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mi>g</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.</p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math>.</p><p>Option <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;are correct</p>",
